# LUNARA — COMPLETE VISUAL, UX & AUTHENTICATION UPGRADE

## Project Identity

**Product:** Lunara  
**Tagline:** A little more thoughtful, every day.

Lunara is a personal daily reflection and self-awareness application. It helps users pause, understand how they're feeling, reflect on their days, record thoughts, notice patterns, and explore their emotional experiences over time.

The app should feel like a personal space — welcoming, visually beautiful, engaging, expressive, comfortable, and thoughtfully designed.

I want you to significantly upgrade my EXISTING Lunara web application. Do not just give me suggestions, design ideas, an audit, or a plan. Inspect the existing codebase, understand its structure, and IMPLEMENT the improvements directly.

